## Benefits Enrollment

### New Hire Enrollment
- Enroll within 30 days of start date
- Coverage effective first day of employment
- Late enrollment requires qualifying event

### Open Enrollment
- Annual period: November 1-15
- Changes effective: January 1
- Required: Review and confirm elections

### Qualifying Life Events
- Marriage/divorce
- Birth/adoption
- Loss of other coverage
- Change in employment status

